FME_PYTHON_PATH "$(FME_MF_DIR)"
FACTORY_DEF {*} PythonFactory    FACTORY_NAME { PythonCaller }    FLUSH_WHEN_GROUPS_CHANGE { <Unused> }    INPUT  FEATURE_TYPE AC_header_CSV_OUTPUT    SYMBOL_NAME { FeatureProcessor }    SOURCE_CODE { import<space>fme<lf>import<space>fmeobjects<lf>import<space>re<lf>import<space>html<space>as<space>html_lib<lf><lf>PARAM_PATTERN<space>=<space>re.compile<openparen>r<quote><backslash><dollar><backslash><openparen><openparen><openbracket>^<closeparen><closebracket>+<closeparen><backslash><closeparen><quote><closeparen><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>$(FME_JOB_ID$encode)<comma><space><dollar><openparen>MY_PARAM<closeparen><lf>ATTR_PATTERN<space>=<space>re.compile<openparen>r<quote><at>Value<backslash><openparen><openparen><openbracket>^<closeparen><closebracket>+<closeparen><backslash><closeparen><quote><closeparen><space><space><space><space>#<space><at>Value<openparen>attr_name<closeparen><lf><lf>OUTPUT_ATTR<space>=<space><quote>html_content<quote><lf>ESCAPE_VALUES<space>=<space>False<lf><lf><lf>class<space>FeatureProcessor<openparen>object<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space>def<space>__init__<openparen>self<closeparen>:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>path<space>=<space>fme.macroValues<openbracket><quote>HTML_TEMPLATE<quote><closebracket>.strip<openparen><closeparen>.strip<openparen><apos><quote><apos><closeparen>.strip<openparen><quote><apos><quote><closeparen><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>with<space>open<openparen>path<comma><space><quote>r<quote><comma><space>encoding=<quote>utf-8<quote><closeparen><space>as<space>f:<lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>template<space>=<space>f.read<openparen><closeparen><lf><lf><space><space><space><space><space><space><space><space>#<space>Parameters<space>are<space>the<space>same<space>for<space>every<space>feature<comma><space>so<space>resolve<space>them<space>once<lf><space><space><space><space>